le, and section upgrades allow you to assign more fruit to a machine, increasing your chances of getting a fruit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/3fba5fb664f42b181ec138027a51e82c.poster.avif?t=1740551584\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/3fba5fb664f42b181ec138027a51e82c.webm?t=1740551584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/3fba5fb664f42b181ec138027a51e82c.mp4?t=1740551584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers unlock like achievements, based on your progress! Each customer has a unique unlock condition and behavior. Some customers will increase buying speed, or rain a fruit storm on you! Others will try to steal your money! There are 15+ customers to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/110223f945c091440a647caf9f27b149.poster.avif?t=1740551584\" width=800 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/110223f945c091440a647caf9f27b149.webm?t=1740551584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/110223f945c091440a647caf9f27b149.mp4?t=1740551584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you help Kate the Cat grow her store from a cardboard box to a fruitful business?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/7a02336403409ca5d0b651796a393a5e.poster.avif?t=1740551584\" width=420 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/7a02336403409ca5d0b651796a393a5e.webm?t=1740551584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306030/extras/7a02336403409ca5d0b651796a393a5e.mp4?t=1740551584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
